    "text": "thewynneprogress.com\nwebsite\nWynne\nSt. Bernards to open pregnancy clinic at CrossRidge Community Hospital\nBy Wynne Progress,\n13 hours agoWYNNE — St. Bernards Healthcare is planning to open a pregnancy clinic this month in partnership with CrossRidge Community Hospital. Emily McGee, a Cross County High School graduate, serves as Assistant Vice President of Nursing at St. Bernards. McGee said before the pregnancy center was opened in 2016, about 13 percent of expectant mothers had no prenatal care. Now, she says, it’s down to one or two patients per month.",
